{"id":"A1-L067","title":"Key verb: keep","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U04","focus":"Verbo-chave: keep","targets":{"grammar":"Verbo-chave: keep","pron":"think/this","verbs":["thank"],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["motto","diary","promise","photo album","memory","treasure","jar","collection","recipe book","vegetable garden","watering can","seed packet","gardener","herbs"],"field":"Moradia","genre":"Biografia","skill":"Fala","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 67 · Key verb: keep","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Verbo-chave: keep.","**Verbos:** thank.","**Pronúncia:** think/this.","**14 palavras novas** (moradia).","**Texto do dia:** biografia."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo usar keep e agradecer com thank em uma biografia."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["motto","lema"],["diary","diário"],["promise","promessa"],["photo album","álbum de fotos"],["memory","lembrança"],["treasure","tesouro"],["jar","pote"],["collection","coleção"],["recipe book","livro de receitas"],["vegetable garden","horta"],["watering can","regador"],["seed packet","pacote de sementes"],["gardener","jardineiro"],["herbs","ervas"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A short biography","blocks":[{"type":"bio","name":"Grandma Rosa","paras":["Rosa **keeps** a small garden. She **keeps** her keys in a blue bowl and **keeps** quiet when people sleep.","Every Sunday she **thanks** her neighbors for the vegetables. “**Keep** the change,” she says to the baker.","Her tip: **keep going** and **keep smiling**."],"years":"Born 1948","facts":[["Home","a small house"],["Hobby","gardening"],["Motto","keep smiling"],["Sunday","thanks neighbors"]],"gloss":[["garden","jardim"],["change","troco"],["bowl","tigela"],["motto","lema"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Rosa keeps a garden.","ans":"T","why":"“keeps a small garden.”"},{"q":"She keeps her keys in a box.","ans":"F","why":"blue bowl."},{"q":"She thanks her neighbors on Sunday.","ans":"T","why":"“Every Sunday.”"}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“keep the change” means…","opts":["fique com o troco","devolva o troco","conte o troco"],"ans":0,"why":"keep the change."},{"q":"“garden” means…","opts":["jardim","garagem","cozinha"],"ans":0,"why":"garden."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Key verb: keep","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Uso","Exemplo"],"rows":[["guardar","**keep the keys in a bowl**"],["manter-se","**keep quiet / keep warm**"],["continuar","**keep going / keep smiling**"],["ficar com","**keep the change**"]],"cap":"Key verb: keep"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**keep + adjetivo** = manter-se; **keep + -ing** = continuar."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"She ___ her keys in a bowl. (keep)","a":"keeps","why":"she → keeps."},{"s":"___ quiet, please. (Keep)","a":"Keep","why":"imperativo."},{"s":"Keep ___ ! (go)","a":"going","why":"keep + -ing."},{"s":"I ___ my neighbors. (thank)","a":"thank","why":"thank."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["garden","jardim"],["change","troco"],["bowl","tigela"],["motto","lema"],["quiet","quieto"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["the","change","Here","is","$10","Keep"],"ans":"Here is $10 Keep the change","pt":"Aqui estão 10. Fique com o troco."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"motto","pos":"word","pt":"lema","ex":"Her motto.","expt":"Seu lema."},{"w":"diary","pos":"word","pt":"diário","ex":"Keep a diary.","expt":"Mantenha um diário."},{"w":"promise","pos":"word","pt":"promessa","ex":"Keep a promise.","expt":"Cumpra uma promessa."},{"w":"photo album","pos":"word","pt":"álbum de fotos","ex":"An old photo album.","expt":"Um álbum de fotos antigo."},{"w":"memory","pos":"word","pt":"lembrança","ex":"A happy memory.","expt":"Uma lembrança feliz."},{"w":"treasure","pos":"word","pt":"tesouro","ex":"A hidden treasure.","expt":"Um tesouro escondido."},{"w":"jar","pos":"word","pt":"pote","ex":"A glass jar.","expt":"Um pote de vidro."},{"w":"collection","pos":"word","pt":"coleção","ex":"A stamp collection.","expt":"Uma coleção de selos."},{"w":"recipe book","pos":"word","pt":"livro de receitas","ex":"Her old recipe book.","expt":"O velho livro de receitas dela."},{"w":"vegetable garden","pos":"word","pt":"horta","ex":"Her vegetable garden.","expt":"A horta dela."},{"w":"watering can","pos":"word","pt":"regador","ex":"A green watering can.","expt":"Um regador verde."},{"w":"seed packet","pos":"word","pt":"pacote de sementes","ex":"A seed packet.","expt":"Um pacote de sementes."},{"w":"gardener","pos":"word","pt":"jardineiro","ex":"A patient gardener.","expt":"Um jardineiro paciente."},{"w":"herbs","pos":"word","pt":"ervas","ex":"Fresh herbs.","expt":"Ervas frescas."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Here is $10. Keep the change.** — Aqui estão 10. Fique com o troco.","**Thank you!** — Obrigado!","**Keep smiling!** — Continue sorrindo!","**Keep going!** — Continue!","**Keep in touch.** — Mantenha contato.","**Keep calm.** — Mantenha a calma."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"keep","pt":"guardar, manter","forms":[["I / you / we / they keep","I keep my keys here."],["he / she / it keeps","She keeps a garden."]]},{"v":"thank","pt":"agradecer","forms":[["I / you / we / they thank","I thank my neighbors."],["he / she / it thanks","He thanks the baker."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"At the bakery","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"At the bakery","lines":[["Rosa","Here is $10. Keep the change.","Aqui estão 10. Fique com o troco."],["Baker","Thank you!","Obrigado!"],["Rosa","Keep smiling!","Continue sorrindo!"],["Baker","You too!","Você também!"]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: think/this","items":[{"label":"think/this","note":"/θ/ sem voz (think) × /ð/ com voz (this): língua entre os dentes.","words":["think","this","three","that","thank","they"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you keep at home.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I keep my keys in a bowl."},{"q":"Encourage a friend.","pt":"Incentive.","model":"Keep going!"},{"q":"Thank someone.","pt":"Agradeça.","model":"Thank you so much."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with keep.","model":"I keep my keys in a bowl. Keep quiet, please. She keeps a garden. Keep the change. Keep going!","checklist":["Usei **keep 3 vezes**","Usei **keep + adjetivo**","Usei **keep + -ing**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “garden” mean?","opts":["jardim","troco","lema"],"ans":0,"why":"**garden** = jardim."},{"q":"What does “change” mean?","opts":["tigela","troco","quieto"],"ans":1,"why":"**change** = troco."},{"q":"What does “bowl” mean?","opts":["lema","quente","tigela"],"ans":2,"why":"**bowl** = tigela."},{"q":"What does “motto” mean?","opts":["lema","quieto","padeiro"],"ans":0,"why":"**motto** = lema."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}